{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dungeon Spheres</strong> is a strategy game where you must eliminate all enemy spheres in each level until none remain. To achieve this, you will randomly summon different classes of spheres, both allied and enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each game is unique since you will never know exactly which spheres will appear. This will force you to adapt, try different combinations, and discover the best strategies for each situation. Some spheres complement each other, enhancing their effectiveness, while others may generate unexpected effects that change the course of the battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn to take advantage of the synergies between spheres to overcome all the replayable levels the game offers. Experiment with different tactics, test new combinations, and find the best way to defeat your opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Example of synergy within the game:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475710/extras/58d38ffa4dae099b5d5b84755eba4070.avif?t=1739538418\" width=800 height=216 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each level can be completed in different ways. Choose your own and have fun!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3475710?t=1739538418","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475710/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1739538418","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475710/9377b9bdd928229fc4a8533de3e0ddc31b4d87cc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1739538418","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475710/9377b9bdd928229fc4a8533de3e0ddc31b4d87cc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1739538418","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_